      "type": "text",
      "baseUrl": "https://api.minimaxi.com/v1",
      "apiDocUrl": "https://platform.minimaxi.com/docs/llms.txt",
      "description": "MiniMax M2.7 极速版，效果不变，输出速度约 100 TPS，上下文窗口 204800",
